# Project conventions

- **Stack:** Next.js (Pages Router in `src/pages`), React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind, pnpm 11, Node 22
- **Package manager:** pnpm only (`pnpm`). Do not use npm or yarn.
- **Tests:** `pnpm test` — never leave Jest in watch mode
- **A11y suite:** `pnpm access` (axe + Lighthouse); static ARIA via `pnpm lint`
- **Prefer** `src/components` and `src/lib` over legacy root `components/` / `lib/`
- **Docs:** `docs/Tooling.md`, agent catalogs in `.cursor/cli/`, skills in `.cursor/skills/`
- Match existing patterns; no drive-by refactors; no secrets in commits
- Line endings in git are LF (see `.gitattributes`)
